1
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:26,694
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,094 --> 00:00:33,709
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,582 --> 00:00:40,720
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,058 --> 00:00:47,067
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,278 --> 00:00:51,199
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,410 --> 00:00:54,501
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,798 --> 00:00:59,033
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,018 --> 00:01:03,926
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,224 --> 00:01:07,110
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:12,202
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,202 --> 00:01:16,782
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,782 --> 00:01:18,781
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,984 --> 00:01:24,766
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:29,461
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,461 --> 00:01:31,969
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,215 --> 00:01:42,432
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,882 --> 00:01:48,716
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,716 --> 00:01:51,634
=Episode 23=

19
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:10,319
- Hurry!
- Run!

20
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:11,584
- Hurry!
- Run!

21
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,680
This way!

22
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,840
Fahai!

23
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:19,639
- Where is Master?
- To save us,

24
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:22,159
Master was killed
by the evil demon in the Forbidden Area.

25
00:03:22,199 --> 00:03:23,199
That evil demon is out.

26
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,919
Master told you not to come back.

27
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:25,960
- Go!
- I'm not leaving.

28
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:26,680
- Go now!
- Go!

29
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,159
- I'm not leaving!
- Go now!

30
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:29,800
- Master!
- Go now!

31
00:03:31,599 --> 00:03:32,599
Master!

32
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:47,240
I'll turn this place to ashes!

33
00:03:47,599 --> 00:03:49,639
Die, all of you!

34
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:35,959
Everyone in Jinshan Temple, listen up!

35
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:38,439
Form the Water Shield Array,

36
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,360
to protect the people
and bring them into the temple.

37
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,920
White Snake,

38
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:58,199
you came just in time.

39
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,399
Today, I'll absorb your demon core.

40
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,720
Don't be so smug.

41
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:05,120
It's too early to say who will win.

42
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:08,279
Suzhen, don't waste your breath on him.

43
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:25,079
Suzhen!

44
00:05:55,879 --> 00:06:00,480
Do you think you can stop me?

45
00:06:27,439 --> 00:06:28,959
I truly don't get it.

46
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,040
With a mere mortal body,

47
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,839
how can you stand against me?

48
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,759
You killed my parents.

49
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:36,720
I will avenge you!

50
00:06:39,639 --> 00:06:41,480
But I've killed too many people.

51
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,800
I can't remember. Apologies.

52
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:56,279
It seems today is truly my lucky day.

53
00:06:56,519 --> 00:07:00,040
Soon, I will absorb
every last one of you

54
00:07:00,959 --> 00:07:04,120
to achieve supreme power!

55
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,720
Dream on.

56
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,480
Qing.

57
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,800
What fine nourishment you two are!

58
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,279
I'll gratefully take them.

59
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:31,439
Suzhen!

60
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:56,000
You want to die?

61
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,000
No rush.

62
00:08:57,679 --> 00:08:59,559
I'll grant your wish soon.

63
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,080
Qing.

64
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:05,960
Xu Xian, don't!

65
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,679
You'll get yourself killed!

66
00:10:33,919 --> 00:10:35,480
I didn't expect that.

67
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,879
Even when you're in danger yourself,

68
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:39,720
yet you still want to protect others?

69
00:10:43,879 --> 00:10:45,559
I missed one?

70
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,440
How dare you ambush me!

71
00:10:50,399 --> 00:10:52,320
If you hadn't extracted me,

72
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,360
I wouldn't have lived like a monster.

73
00:10:55,399 --> 00:10:59,360
Traitor, then I'll kill you as well.

74
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:45,559
Qing!

75
00:11:45,559 --> 00:11:47,360
Qing!

76
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:50,399
What's with that look?

77
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,360
I'm a demon.

78
00:11:53,639 --> 00:11:55,000
I don't die that easily.

79
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,240
Don't talk.

80
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,679
I'll use the Leifeng Pagoda to heal you.

81
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,080
Remember,

82
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:09,000
don't activate
the wrong array this time.

83
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:12,919
(This thing never works
when I need it to.)

84
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,240
(It just malfunctioned again.)

85
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,960
(I told you not to come,
but you ignored.)

86
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,279
(You were in my barrier array,)

87
00:12:17,279 --> 00:12:18,799
and now we formed a contract.

88
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,480
That means

89
00:12:21,679 --> 00:12:23,320
I'm your...

90
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,759
S-Stop that!

91
00:12:25,279 --> 00:12:26,279
Shut up.

92
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,240
Eat.

93
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,440
Get out.

94
00:12:34,759 --> 00:12:36,480
Fahai, let me ask you,

95
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:40,080
if love is so wonderful,

96
00:12:41,679 --> 00:12:42,840
why is it a trial?

97
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:47,320
Love is born from desire.

98
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:51,600
Desire arises from craving,

99
00:12:53,519 --> 00:12:54,720
and the trial begins.

100
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,320
Don't fall asleep.

101
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,320
Don't fall asleep.

102
00:13:01,399 --> 00:13:02,399
Don't fall asleep.

103
00:13:05,679 --> 00:13:08,360
This is my final order to you.

104
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,960
You must not die.

105
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,200
Qing!

106
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,200
Qing!

107
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,240
Qing!

108
00:13:26,519 --> 00:13:27,519
Qing!

109
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,240
Qing!

110
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,320
Qing!

111
00:14:01,919 --> 00:14:06,519
(I only hope you can comprehend
the great Dao soon,)

112
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:08,519
(achieve enlightenment in Buddhism,)

113
00:14:08,759 --> 00:14:12,639
(and protect the peace
of the people in my stead.)

114
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,320
Master.

115
00:14:20,639 --> 00:14:21,639
Master!

116
00:14:21,639 --> 00:14:22,639
Master!

117
00:14:26,799 --> 00:14:27,799
Fahai.

118
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:32,600
This is merely a wisp of consciousness
I left within you.

119
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:37,519
Your arrival here
proves you've enlightened.

120
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:41,120
I am truly gratified.

121
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:44,879
Master, so many people
have died out there.

122
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:47,200
All my fellows are dead.

123
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:49,320
Bai and Qing have been defeated too.

124
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,399
Master, what should I do?

125
00:14:50,639 --> 00:14:51,799
Help me, Master!

126
00:14:51,799 --> 00:14:53,159
- Please help me!
- Fahai.

127
00:14:54,039 --> 00:14:57,320
I know you have much to say.

128
00:14:59,519 --> 00:15:01,480
Amitabha.

129
00:15:02,559 --> 00:15:04,120
Mortal bodies

130
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:06,440
will eventually reach their limits.

131
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:08,960
Ask not of cause and effect,

132
00:15:09,399 --> 00:15:10,840
ask not of success or failure.

133
00:15:11,559 --> 00:15:13,600
Just fulfill our duty in the present,

134
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,799
and protect those we can.

135
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,279
Go.

136
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:38,159
Amitabha.

137
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:11,440
You'll understand eventually

138
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:14,320
that everything you do now

139
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:19,039
will inevitably turn against you
in another way.

140
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:27,320
You and I have always been one.

141
00:16:28,919 --> 00:16:31,320
Now my time has come to an end.

142
00:16:34,919 --> 00:16:36,240
You are right.

143
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:43,919
This is the retribution I must bear.

144
00:17:16,370 --> 00:17:20,529
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

145
00:17:22,996 --> 00:17:27,374
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

146
00:17:28,917 --> 00:17:34,742
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

147
00:17:35,511 --> 00:17:39,978
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

148
00:17:42,843 --> 00:17:47,284
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

149
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:54,210
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

150
00:17:55,422 --> 00:18:01,535
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

151
00:18:02,198 --> 00:18:07,980
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

152
00:18:07,980 --> 00:18:14,243
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

153
00:18:14,553 --> 00:18:20,912
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

154
00:18:21,083 --> 00:18:28,450
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

155
00:18:28,735 --> 00:18:34,282
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

156
00:18:34,773 --> 00:18:40,983
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

157
00:18:41,293 --> 00:18:48,066
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

158
00:18:49,063 --> 00:18:54,716
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

159
00:18:55,550 --> 00:18:59,958
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

160
00:19:00,723 --> 00:19:03,311
♪Having ever loved♪
